{"id":400302501,"chapter_id":50014,"scene_id":51427,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>这是哪里……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>刚刚……我好像又见到那个男人……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>多久没见他了……我还是不理解他的黑暗……还是会逃避……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>……这就是我的理想吗……这份恐惧……好可怕……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"一阵嘈杂声传来。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>谁……谁在外面？</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"丽莎","content":"……你是说，只要能让索西亚感受恐惧，就能逆转这里的力量？你的脑袋是绣花的吗？","voice":["vo_event_03025_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"海拉","content":"嘿，我倒觉得不错诶，我可擅长了！像这样——","voice":["vo_event_03025_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哎哟这算什么丢人玩意哦，恐惧的领域？真实的化身？我们可是一根水管捅穿黑环的人，就这就这就这？","voice":["vo_event_03025_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>她们……在害怕……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"海拉","content":"吞了个普级禁闭者就敢这么得瑟，真是没见过世面！出来跟我单挑呀！","voice":["vo_event_03025_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"来、来单挑！有我辛迪加弓箭死神在，让你吃不了兜着走！挑战我之前，记得先过局长这关！","voice":["vo_event_03025_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>可为什么……她们还站在这里……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>明明都是禁闭者，明明我们都受过狂厄的洗礼，见证过残酷真相，见证过黑暗与恐怖的深渊……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>为什么他们能逃脱恐惧的支配？为什么他们能够拥有消解恐惧的力量？为什么我的力量却在不断地流逝？</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哦哦她看起来好不自在，被我吓到了吧？来来继续——嗯？你跑上来干嘛？","voice":["vo_event_03025_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"一个熟悉的身影出现在她面前。","style":3,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>……是他？</color></i>","female_content":"……是她？","voice":["vo_event_03025_19","vo_event_03025_19f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"魔女的结界在颤抖，它快坚持不下去了吗？","voice":["vo_event_03025_20","vo_event_03025_20f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"因为你害怕太多东西。畏惧枷锁，畏惧未知的力量，更怕被你困住的恩菲尔受我影响……但躲起来是没用的，逃避可是恐惧最好的催化剂。","voice":["vo_event_03025_21","vo_event_03025_21f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"出来，索西亚。被恐惧困住的人只有你。","voice":["vo_event_03025_22","vo_event_03025_22f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>是因为……我在恐惧？一直以来，被恐惧困住、无法逃脱的人，是我？</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_03025_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"索西亚","content":"你是说……我在恐惧？一直以来，被恐惧困住、无法逃脱的人，是我？","voice":["vo_event_03025_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"索西亚","content":"别做梦了！我是她的杰作，是恐惧的化身，我才是真实的支配者！","voice":["vo_event_03024_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p2","style":1,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"content":"真可怜，她还不明白，纯粹的恐惧是最强大，也最弱小的敌人。你遭遇的所有困境都不是因为它不可战胜，仅仅因为你曾经懦弱罢了。","style":3,"background":2031,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"要打破魔女之夜，你要战胜的只有自己。","style":3,"background":2031,"log_type":1}]}